WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.234
Welcome, welcome, welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:04.968
[ Cheers and applause ] Thank you very much.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.767
Enjoy yourself. Welcome to the show, guys.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.334
This is a big day in business news.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:12.334
I saw that JetBlue is offering to buy Spirit Airlines

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.734
for $3.6 billion.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.834
Yeah. Right now Spirit is like,

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.534
"Guys, we better open a bank account.

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.767
I think -- I think it's time -- I think it's time, yeah."

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:22.934
[ Laughter ] Don't worry.

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:24.701
It'll still be the same Spirit Airlines,

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:26.968
except now every seat will have a TV that doesn't work

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:28.267
and a bag of Blue Chips.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.367
Yeah.

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:31.534
And listen to this.

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.200
Uber just announced that it will introduce

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.067
plane bookings in the U.K.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.100
Planes. Yeah.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.634
If you thought talkative drivers were annoying...

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.868
"So, then I tried my hand at woodworking,

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:45.167
but that didn't pan out, so..."

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.534
Has anyone here been on former President Trump's

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.901
social-media app, Truth Social?

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:53.501
Well, that's the problem. Anyway, it's --

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:54.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:57.501
Apparently Trump is upset, he's furious,

00:00:57.501 --> 00:01:00.434
'cause his Truth Social app is a flop.

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:02.067
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:03.667
Yep.

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:06.000
Trump hasn't been this mad about an app since someone sent him

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.767
Buffalo cauliflower tenders by mistake.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.868
[As Trump] "What is this?

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:14.767
I want the fingers of the chicken please.

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:18.300
In the shape of a dinosaur. Thank you."

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.567
Yep. Truth Social isn't very popular.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:22.200
At this point, even Rudy Giuliani's

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.200
OnlyFans account has more traffic.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.100
[ Laughter ] That's right.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.868
Trump is furious 'cause other than Trump Airlines,

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:30.400
Trump Steak, Trump Vodka,

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.767
Trump Mortgage, "Trump" Magazine,

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:32.968
and Trump University,

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.367
it is the first business fail of his career.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.000
So, yeah.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.234
Well, I read that as bird flu

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:40.901
continues to spread across the country,

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:43.367
zoos are moving their birds inside

00:01:43.367 --> 00:01:45.734
to protect them from the virus.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.367
It's weird. Right now all of the birds

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:49.100
