00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.601
and watching "Tiger King."

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:51.667
[ Laughter ] Isn't that weird?

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:53.167
-Wow.

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:54.501
-You guys see this?

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:55.868
Just in time for baseball season,

00:01:55.868 --> 00:01:58.734
Frito-Lay is selling a new version of Cracker Jacks

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.234
called Cracker Jill.

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:02.767
Take a look at this. Yeah.

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:05.067
So, yeah, we can all stop worrying about gender equality.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:06.667
We did it.

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.100
Cracker Jill.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.667
