00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:20.067
using up to 50 different "words."

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:22.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.901
I'm pretty sure the study was conducted

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.334
by a scientist on mushrooms.

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:27.100
That probably makes some better sense.

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.033
Oh, I'm kidding. He sounds like a fungi. Uh...

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:31.701
"What's that? Five picture deal with Pixar?

00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:34.267
Sure. Let's go for six."

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.667
Hey, guys. It is time to take a look at the stories

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:39.300
